{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Net Raiders is a single-player game that combines RPG, deck-building, and roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to survive the dangers of the ruined virtual world, you must fuse\u00a0the cards in your hand to find the best move and defeat the enemies you encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also, besides enemies, you never know what events you may face in this ruined virtual world, so always be cautious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On this arduous journey, choose and fuse cards, chips, and items that suit your deck to help your character save this virtual world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card Merge System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can merge two same cards in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three merge types and the effect varies depending on the merge type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Merge_Enhance_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><strong>Enhance </strong>- Card effects change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Merge_Supply_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><strong>Supply </strong>- Draw a card from the merged position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Merge_Transform_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><strong>Transform </strong>- It turns into one of the cards in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various Card Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Cond_Jack_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Cond_Coldheart_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" />Most cards have various conditions that amplify their effects, and players must consider these conditions to use cards with the highest efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players should consider using the card with the best efficiency by satisfying this conditional expression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about the conditional expressions of the cards when constructing a deck or in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Player Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Gunner_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" />Each character has a unique set of cards and mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your cards and chips together as you play the game to complete your own perfect deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every run has a new play experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you play, you encounter a new combination of events, cards, and chips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think hard and try different strategies, fail, and taste success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contact - <a href=\"mailto:obliqoninc@gmail.com\">obliqoninc@gmail.com</a></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520780?t=1746084928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520780?t=1746084928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/cde6632f58bc79bb7980062491c721820becaa16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746084928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/cde6632f58bc79bb7980062491c721820becaa16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746084928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2524430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Net Raiders is a single-player game that combines RPG, deck-building, and roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to survive the dangers of the ruined virtual world, you must fuse\u00a0the cards in your hand to find the best move and defeat the enemies you encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also, besides enemies, you never know what events you may face in this ruined virtual world, so always be cautious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On this arduous journey, choose and fuse cards, chips, and items that suit your deck to help your character save this virtual world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card Merge System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can merge two same cards in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three merge types and the effect varies depending on the merge type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Merge_Enhance_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><strong>Enhance </strong>- Card effects change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Merge_Supply_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><strong>Supply </strong>- Draw a card from the merged position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Merge_Transform_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><strong>Transform </strong>- It turns into one of the cards in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various Card Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Cond_Jack_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Cond_Coldheart_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" />Most cards have various conditions that amplify their effects, and players must consider these conditions to use cards with the highest efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players should consider using the card with the best efficiency by satisfying this conditional expression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about the conditional expressions of the cards when constructing a deck or in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Player Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/Gunner_steam.gif?t=1746084928\" />Each character has a unique set of cards and mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your cards and chips together as you play the game to complete your own perfect deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every run has a new play experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you play, you encounter a new combination of events, cards, and chips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think hard and try different strategies, fail, and taste success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contact - <a href=\"mailto:obliqoninc@gmail.com\">obliqoninc@gmail.com</a></p>","